+<p class="disclosure">Project status (VSO published disclosure, 25 October 2026): zero external implementations · commercial figures withdrawn pending verification (24 October 2026; not a zero-count finding) · zero Evidence Packs accepted in any proceeding.</p>
+<p>VAP is tamper-evident, not tamper-proof — post-hoc evidentiary infrastructure, never runtime control.</p>
